<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We don’t care for the Bios, we don’t care for the soul.</l><l>We don’t care for the cares of life, world’s pleasure and show.</l><l>We don’t care for the pride of life, the flesh and sin—</l><l>We say, “No!” to the soul life, we’ll take God’s life within.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Do you know what God’s life is? Well, just listen to this:</l><l>It is God in Christ Jesus through the Spirit—no less!</l><l>He is flowing within us, He is flowing through—</l><l>Hallelujah! He’s moving to make everything new.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>We have this Life within us, in our spirit today;</l><l>To our spirit we turn, O Lord, and take You this way.</l><l>We can overcome Bios and the Psuche too;</l><l>Hallelujah, the Spirit of the Lord takes us through.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
